#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えー、校内放送でーす。
#. 午後１０時になりました。
msgctxt "0002 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Mm, ahem, this is a school announcement. It is now 10\n"
"p.m."
msgstr ""

#. ただいまより<CLT 3>“夜時間”<CLT>になります。
msgctxt "0003 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "As such, it is officially <CLT 3>nighttime<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 間もなく食堂はドアをロックされますので、
#. 立ち入り禁止となりま～す。
msgctxt "0004 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Soon the doors to the dining hall will be locked, and\n"
"entry at that point is strictly prohibited."
msgstr ""

#. ではでは、いい夢を…
#. おやすみなさい…
msgctxt "0005 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Okay then...sweet dreams, everyone! Good night, sleep\n"
"tight, don't let the bed bugs bite..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今日も…終わりか……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Today's already come to an end...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、明日こそ…
#. 絶対に手掛かりを掴んでやる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I swear...tomorrow I'm going to find some kind of\n"
"clue!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>絶対に…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I swear!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>目を閉じながら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As my eyelids began to slide closed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの頭の中では、
#. 朝の舞園さんとの会話が何度も繰り返されていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the conversation I'd had with Sayaka that morning\n"
"began to replay.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは…悔しかったのかもしれない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In a way, it's almost frustrating...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクには、彼女の怒りを理解出来ても、
#. それを共有する事は出来ない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even if I understand where her desperation is coming\n"
"from, I can't share in it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女はボクみたいな普通の高校生とは
#. 背負っている物が違うから…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The pressure she's under is way different from\n"
"anything a normal high schooler like me goes through.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女は、ボクみたいな適当な気持ちで、
#. この学園に来た訳じゃないんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She didn't just stumble into this school the way I\n"
"did.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから…ボクには彼女の怒りを共有出来ない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So I can't say I feel things the way she does.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは…彼女とは…
#. いや他のみんなとは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Compared to her...no, compared to everyone else\n"
"here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…決定的に違う。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...there's no doubt I just don't match up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それが…悔しかったのかもしれない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess that might explain my own frustration.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>……………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えー、ご覧のみなさま…
#. すでにコロシアイ学園生活は始まっている訳ですが…
msgctxt "0020 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Ahem, so...I'm sure that you've noticed the killing\n"
"game has begun, but..."
msgstr ""

#. 本当に…笑っちゃいますよね…
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...there's still room for a little laughter."
msgstr ""

#. この希望あふれる新入生のみなさんは、
#. まだ自分達が、逃げられると思ってるみたいですよ！
msgctxt "0022 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It seems our newest students, already so filled with\n"
"despair, still have some hope of escape!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…いつになったら始まるんですかねぇ？
msgctxt "0023 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu... So when will it begin?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“希望”<CLT>同士のコロシアイは…！
msgctxt "0024 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "When will their <CLT 3>hope<CLT> begin to die?"
msgstr ""

#. まだかな…まだかな…
msgctxt "0025 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Is it time yet? Is it time!?"
msgstr ""

#. ワックワックのドッキドッキだよねっ！！
msgctxt "0026 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Heartpounding excitement!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. オマエラ、おはようございます！
#. 朝です、７時になりました！　起床時間ですよ～！
msgctxt "0028 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Good morning, everyone! It is now 7 a.m. and nighttime\n"
"is officially over! Time to rise and shine!"
msgstr ""

#. さぁて、今日も張り切っていきましょう～！
msgctxt "0029 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Get ready to greet another beee-yutiful day!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…朝だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...Morning has come.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今日は…これからどうしよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What should I do today?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ、時間はあるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's still lots of time left in the day.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じっとしている気分じゃない。
#. どこかに行ってみようかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I really don't feel like just sitting here. Maybe I'll\n"
"take a look around...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このドアは、建付けが悪いんだったな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This door doesn't quite fit in the doorframe.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 開け方のコツ、忘れないようにしないと。
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I'll have to make sure and remember the trick to\n"
"opening it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、またいつモノクマが出てくるかと思うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't even wanna think about when he might show up\n"
"on that thing next...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はぁ……
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラに見られてると思うと…
#. まったく落ち着かないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When I think about being constantly watched on these\n"
"cameras...it just stresses me out.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0040 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0041 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間もあるし、少し休もうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have some time, so maybe I should take a little\n"
"rest...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>特になんの仕掛けもない…
#. 普通のゴミ箱みたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just an everyday trash can. I don't see any kind of\n"
"trapdoor or hidden compartments or anything...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しのある机だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A desk with a few drawers.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>よくある学生用って感じだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the kind of thing any student would have.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>メモ帳がある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a notepad.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんがボクに言ってくれた言葉でも
#. メモっておこうかな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I should write down what Sayaka told me earlier.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…工具セットだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...a toolkit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ビニールの包装がされてる。
#. まだ新品の未開封品みたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It must be brand-new. It's still in the shrink-wrap.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まぁ、工具セットなんて使う事はないだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, I don't think I need it right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは…粘着テープクリーナーだな。
#. 掃除はご自由にって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's some kind of lint roller. I guess we're supposed\n"
"to clean up after ourselves...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>紙は、はがしたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I tore the paper off the wall, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの内容を思い出すだけでも、
#. 嫌な気分になる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...just remembering what it said still makes me feel\n"
"queasy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>簡素な雰囲気の個室に…金箔の模擬刀…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The only thing in my room is...a fake sword covered in\n"
"gold.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>違和感以外のなにものでもない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All it does is make me feel that much more\n"
"uncomfortable.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>簡素な雰囲気の個室に…金箔の模擬刀…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The only thing in my room is...a fake sword covered in\n"
"gold.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>違和感以外のなにものでもない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All it does is make me feel that much more\n"
"uncomfortable.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだよ、この鉄板…
#. ここは牢獄じゃないんだぞ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's with this metal barricade? This is supposed to\n"
"be a school, not a prison...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだよ、この鉄板…
#. ここは牢獄じゃないんだぞ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's with this metal barricade? This is supposed to\n"
"be a school, not a prison...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0060 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0061 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
